The damage engine and game data in this directory are derived from
tpdpextcalc (https://github.com/Gengetsu12/tpdpextcalc), a Touhou Puppet
Dance Performance damage calculator, which is itself derived from the
Pokémon Showdown damage calculator.

Original framework by Choon; TPDP Extended adaptation by The_Eevee_Man
and contributors.

